lint/issues/comments/64813599/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nzakas","id":38546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas","html_url":"https://github.com/nzakas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/64852513","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1513#issuecomment-64852513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1513","id":64852513,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0ODUyNTEz","user":{"login":"zmthy","id":172896,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Mjg5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172896?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy","html_url":"https://github.com/zmthy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-11-28T04:12:10Z","updated_at":"2014-11-28T04:12:10Z","body":"The consistent-this rule insists that if I declare a variable with the same name as the designated `this` alias (which defaults to `self`), then I must set the variable to `this` in the declaration. So if I write:\n\n``` js\nvar foo, self;\nself = this;\n```\n\nI get this output:\n\n```\n1:0  error  Designated 'this' alias 'self' is not assigned to the current execution context  consistent-this\n```\n\nThis is appropriate given the purpose of the rule, but I'd like an option to turn it off in case I'm using this particular grouping style of declarations.\n\nThe consistent-this rule _also_ insists that you may not assign `this` to any variable with any other name, but it only enforces this rule on initial variable declarations. For instance, if I write (still using the default of `self`):\n\n``` js\nvar that = this;\n```\n\nI get this (correct) error:\n\n```\n1:0  error  Unexpected alias 'that' for 'this'  consistent-this\n```\n\nBut if I perform the assignment later:\n\n``` js\nvar foo, that;\nthat = this;\n```\n\nI would expect an error about assigning `this` to `that`, but the rule ignores assignments outside of variable declarations.\n\nSo, given this particular style of variable declarations, the rule only ever reports an error on cases where I'm using the alias correctly, and never on cases where I'm using it incorrectly. This change would have it inspect assignments to identifiers, banning anything that is not `{{alias}} = this`, and include an option to allow empty variable declarations of the alias.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/64852513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zmthy","id":172896,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Mjg5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172896?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy","html_url":"https://github.com/zmthy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmthy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/70416709","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1513#issuecomment-70416709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1513","id":70416709,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcwNDE2NzA5","user":{"login":"nzakas","id":38546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas","html_url":"https://github.com/nzakas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user